B.xB=new A.bn(B.VC,["Reorder setups","Drag setups into your preferred order. Favorites stay at the top.","My Bikes","Reorder bikes","Hold a bike card and drag it into position. The other bikes move aside as you drag. Changes are saved automatically.","Done","Settings","Colors & appearance","Choose a palette color or enter a hex value. Valid entries are saved immediately. The checkmark shows your current color.","Apply color","Choose color","Tap or drag on the palette to choose your color.","Hue","Saturation","Brightness","Background color","Accent color","Preview your colors","Reset colors","Custom color (hex)","Enter 6 hex characters, e.g. 009688.","Language","New Bike","Search brand or model...","Tutorial / Information","No bikes found.","Add new Bike","Choose from Database","Pre-configured top models with suspension specs","Create manually","Enter brand, model, and travel yourself","New Bike","Add Cover Photo","Change Cover Photo","Brand","Model (Tap to search database)","e.g. Megatower","Category","Front Travel (mm)","Rear Travel (mm)","Save Bike","Specs applied for","!","New Setup","add new Setup","Configure Suspension","Rename","Duplicate","Delete Setup?","Do you really want to delete the setup ","? This action cannot be undone.","Bike not found","New Name","(Copy)","Front","Rear","details","Fork","Shock","Tires","Front tire model","Front tire pressure","Rear tire model","Rear tire pressure","History","Delete history","Delete history?","Do you really want to delete the entire history of this setup? This cannot be undone. The current setup values will be kept.","Notes","General remarks (e.g., trail conditions, weather...)","No adjustments recorded yet.","New Value","Reason (Optional)","e.g. more support...","What is this?","Got it","Not set","Air","Setup name","e.g. Schladming","Please enter a name.","Create setup","FORK SETTINGS","SHOCK TYPE","SHOCK SETTINGS","TIRES","Main Air Pressure","2nd Chamber / OTT","High-Speed Comp. (HSC)","Low-Speed Comp. (LSC)","High-Speed Rebound (HSR)","Low-Speed Rebound (LSR)","Tokens (Spacers)","Hydraulic Bottom-Out (HBO)","Air","Coil","Air Pressure","Spring Rate","Preload","Main","Neg/OTT","Tokens","Spring","Preload","{component}: {field}","Clicks","Pieces","Turns","PSI/Clicks","Low-Speed Compression: Controls compression during slow suspension movements (e.g. pedaling, braking, berms). More LSC = more support, less = more traction.","High-Speed Compression: Absorbs fast, harsh impacts (e.g. root sections, big rocks, hard landings).","Low-Speed Rebound: Controls the extension speed after normal bumps. Too fast = bike bounces, too slow = suspension packs down.","High-Speed Rebound: Controls extension after deep compressions to prevent the rear end from bucking on jumps.","Determines the baseline stiffness (sag) of the suspension based on rider weight.","Volume Spacers: Alter bottom-out resistance. More tokens = harder to bottom out.","Hydraulic Bottom-Out: Extra hydraulic resistance at the very end of the stroke.","Off The Top: Regulates initial stroke sensitivity without affecting mid/end stroke.","The stiffness of the coil spring, chosen based on rider weight.","Coil spring preload. Warning: Do not use it to adjust sag (max. 2\u20133 turns)!","Track Tires & Pressure","Save Configuration","Save Changes","Setup Configuration","Shock type for this setup","Unsaved changes","You changed the configuration. Save it before leaving this screen.","Keep editing","Discard","Show notes field","Edit field","Delete field from library","Delete field?","The field and its saved values will be removed from every bike and setup.","Number","Text","Yes / No","Yes","No","Custom field","Delete category","Delete category?","The category, including all fields and saved values, will also be removed from every other bike and setup. To only hide the fields, deactivate them in the respective bike or setup instead.","Rename category","Arrange fields","Done","Briefly hold and drag to move","Hold and drag to move the category","Briefly hold a field and drag it to the desired position within its category. To move an entire category, hold and drag its heading or the handle next to it.","Apply field order?","Apply this order to the other setups of this bike as well? Values and enabled fields will stay unchanged.","Only this setup","Apply to all","Add new category","Change unit","Unit","Default","New category","Category name","Create","Add custom field","Field name","Value type","None","Custom unit","Add","Notes about {category} \u2026","Setup not found","Edit Bike","Model","Delete Bike","Delete Bike?","Do you really want to delete this bike? All setups will be lost permanently.","Required","Error","Cancel","Save","Delete","Welcome to Bike Setup Tracker! \ud83d\udeb2","I have created a demo bike for you so you can try out the features right away.","Long-press a bike card on the home screen to open the menu. Choose to edit the bike or reorder your bikes. To delete a bike, choose \u201cEdit Bike\u201d.","Let's go!"],t.li)
